# Allowlist: deny everything by default, then re-include only the paths that
# COPY statements in docker/Dockerfile actually reference.  This ensures that
# TLS private keys, SQLite databases, bearer-token files, .git history,
# virtualenvs, dev-data directories, and caches never enter the build context,
# even if they are present in the working tree.
*

# --- what the Dockerfile needs (must match every COPY source exactly) ---
!ffmpeg-pin.json
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src
!alembic.ini
!alembic
!docker
